  "body": "Deadline Sale\r\nThursday 12 November 2026 at 3:00PM \r\n(unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nStriking modern design, a flat freehold section and a practical four-bedroom layout make this newly built, freestanding home an appealing choice for family living. Its bold roofline, vertical cladding and distinctive balcony screening create an impressive first impression.\r\n\r\nWith Westlake Boys' High School and Forrest Hill School just across the road, and Westlake Girls' High School also within walking distance, school mornings become so much easier. From primary through to secondary school, spend less time driving and queuing for daily drop-offs and pick-ups.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, the open-plan kitchen, dining and living areas provide a welcoming setting for family time and entertaining. A guest toilet, laundry and internal-access single garage add everyday convenience.\r\nUpstairs, four bedrooms include a master with an ensuite and balcony access. A separate family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms, while a study nook provides a useful space for homework or working from home.\r\n\r\nMilford's shops, cafes and beach are also within easy reach, bringing together school-day convenience and a relaxed North Shore lifestyle.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n* Freestanding home on a flat, freehold section\r\n* Four bedrooms, two bathrooms and a guest toilet\r\n* Master bedroom with ensuite and balcony access\r\n* Upstairs study nook\r\n* Internal-access single garage\r\n* Approx. 162.3m2 floor area, including garage, excluding balcony\r\n* Additional 7m2 balcony\r\n* Walk to Forrest Hill School, Westlake Boys and Westlake Girls\r\n\r\nAlso Available - Lot 2\r\n\r\nLot 2 offers another stylish freestanding home on a flat, freehold section, with four bedrooms, two bathrooms, a guest toilet and an internal-access single garage. It features approximately 148.3m2 of floor area, including the garage and excluding the additional 6m2 balcony. With the same convenient school location, it is another appealing option for families.\r\n\r\nContact Lily today to view both homes and find the one that suits you best.\r\n\r\n*Areas are based on the supplied plans and are subject to final confirmation.",
